# The root .gitignore (upstream VS Code's) ignores product.overrides.json everywhere, meaning its own
# dev-time override file at the repo root. This one is the Oyren Editor's branding, packed into
# editor-extras and required by composer's install-editor.sh, so it stays tracked. (It was ignored,
# hence never committed, until 2026-11-27; the pack script then failed on a clean checkout.)
!product.overrides.json
